=== A: the position form alone
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_d                          assume  unprocessed
m_one1                       assume  unprocessed
m_one2                       assume  unprocessed
p_head1                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
p_head2                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
p_ahead                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
=== B: the slot helpers and the ordering, alone
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_d                          assume  unprocessed
m_one1                       assume  unprocessed
m_one2                       assume  unprocessed
h_slots                      assert  proven        informal-kind
c_inside                     cover   covered       informal-kind depth 3
=== C: both forms, the helpers assumed
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_d                          assume  unprocessed
m_one1                       assume  unprocessed
m_one2                       assume  unprocessed
m_slots                      assume  unprocessed
p_head1                      assert  proven        informal-kind
p_head2                      assert  proven        informal-kind
p_ahead                      assert  proven        informal-kind
a_order                      assert  proven        informal-kind
a_once1                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_once2                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_both                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 3
=== D: the mutant that reads a word twice
--- informal-bmc, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_d                          assume  unprocessed
m_one1                       assume  unprocessed
m_one2                       assume  unprocessed
p_head1                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 3
p_head2                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 3
p_ahead                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 4
a_order                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 6
a_once1                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 3
a_once2                      assert  cex           informal-bmc depth 5
verdict: order proven by position with slot helpers; the flag form's once-only checks still need an invariant over every slot
